{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12109160","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12109160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1210916001:1":{"text":"辛巴达……前面还、还会有冲来冲去的野兽吗？","source_cn":"辛巴达……前面还、还会有冲来冲去的野兽吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF401332DAF53F738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210916002:1":{"text":"不好说啊，我倒是希望它们能换点花样。","source_cn":"不好说啊，我倒是希望它们能换点花样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1C796C3BCC6D8C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210916003:1":{"text":"我已经受够了！","source_cn":"我已经受够了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BE03476A60FCBCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210916004:1":{"text":"打起精神，至少我们离宝藏越来越近了！","source_cn":"打起精神，至少我们离宝藏越来越近了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A6741D3EBC54B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210916005:1":{"text":"辛巴达，你好像对冒险和寻宝很有经验。","source_cn":"辛巴达，你好像对冒险和寻宝很有经验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D0F9A5DB46DFFB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210916006:1":{"text":"刚才如果没有你，一定很危险。","s